lease transmembrane proteins into  the plasma membrane these proteins can  change their shape dramatically in  response to external signals these  changes in shape allow them to bind to  other proteins which in the case of this  macrophage causes it to stop rolling  dramatically change shape and squeeze in  between two neighboring and Abilio cells  to go and fight infection in the tissue  you  you  [Music]

